1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,230
Theo walks out of the door.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,820
And a bell rings.

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,986
In this world, a bell rings the last

4
00:00:07,006 --> 00:00:08,735
time you'll see someone.

5
00:00:08,755 --> 00:00:10,159
Everyone hears it.

6
00:00:10,179 --> 00:00:12,249
Nobody knows what comes after.

7
00:00:14,199 --> 00:00:15,819
You've heard bells before.

8
00:00:15,839 --> 00:00:17,894
The old man at the bus stop.

9
00:00:17,914 --> 00:00:18,509
Ding.

10
00:00:18,529 --> 00:00:20,023
You never saw him again.

11
00:00:20,043 --> 00:00:21,573
Kofi the barista.

12
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:22,325
Ding.

13
00:00:22,345 --> 00:00:23,514
He moved to Lisbon.

14
00:00:23,534 --> 00:00:24,389
You never cared.

15
00:00:24,409 --> 00:00:25,747
They were just bells.

16
00:00:27,397 --> 00:00:29,241
But that one was Theo's.

17
00:00:29,261 --> 00:00:30,691
You run to the window.

18
00:00:30,711 --> 00:00:31,930
He's already gone.

19
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,030
You call him.

20
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,294
No answer.

21
00:00:34,314 --> 00:00:35,969
The last thing you said to your brother

22
00:00:35,989 --> 00:00:38,263
was: shut the door properly.

23
00:00:38,283 --> 00:00:39,992
You run to the station.

24
00:00:40,012 --> 00:00:41,367
The train has gone.

25
00:00:41,387 --> 00:00:43,034
The platform is empty.

26
00:00:45,384 --> 00:00:46,895
What are you doing here?

27
00:00:47,045 --> 00:00:47,475
Theo.

28
00:00:47,495 --> 00:00:48,475
Behind you.

29
00:00:48,495 --> 00:00:50,607
With two suitcases and a lamp.

30
00:00:50,627 --> 00:00:51,302
The bell!

31
00:00:51,332 --> 00:00:52,315
I heard the bell!

32
00:00:52,335 --> 00:00:52,965
I told you.

33
00:00:52,985 --> 00:00:53,945
I'm moving out.

34
00:00:53,965 --> 00:00:55,381
Into Mira's old flat.

35
00:00:55,401 --> 00:00:56,711
It's two streets away.

36
00:00:57,261 --> 00:00:58,716
The bell was right.

37
00:00:58,736 --> 00:01:00,666
It was the last time you'd see him living

38
00:01:00,686 --> 00:01:01,996
in your flat.

39
00:01:02,016 --> 00:01:04,296
Bells tell you when something ends.

40
00:01:04,316 --> 00:01:05,936
Not what comes next.

41
00:01:05,956 --> 00:01:07,934
Who would you hug if you heard the bell?
